# Detection 01 – Process Creation

## Description

This detection identifies process creation events captured by **Microsoft Sysmon (Event ID 1)** and ingested into **Splunk Enterprise**.

Process creation monitoring provides visibility into every executable launched on a Windows endpoint and forms the foundation of endpoint detection and response. Since almost every attacker action begins with creating a process, Event ID 1 is considered one of the highest-value telemetry sources for Security Operations Centers (SOCs).

