# Analyst Notes

Process Creation (Sysmon Event ID 1) is one of the most valuable telemetry sources available to defenders. It provides complete visibility into endpoint execution activity and serves as the foundation for many advanced detections including PowerShell abuse, LOLBins, malware execution, persistence techniques, and privilege escalation.

This detection establishes the baseline required for the remaining detections within this Splunk Detection Engineering project.
